Module(
  body=[
    Expr(
      value=Constant(value='\nMain Entry Point — v10_9 Agentic Workflow (META-AWARE, FULL STACK L1–L5)\n\nThis module is the ONLY top-level orchestrator responsible for running\nthe entire agentic workflow end-to-end. It coordinates all layers:\n\n    • L1: Planning (strategy, rag, drafting, bullets, qa, safety, meta, prompt_eng)\n    • L2: Execution (retrieval, drafting, QA, safety evaluation, meta)\n    • L3: Orchestration (DAG execution)\n    • L4: State (memory, patches, correction logs)\n    • L5: Safety, Policy, Arbitration\n\nAdditionally, this refactored version fully incorporates the META\nprofile biasing layer based on 10_8 → 10_9 restoration and the 14\nOpenAI agentic subdomain requirements.\n\nKEY FEATURES (UPGRADED):\n\n    • Fully typed PlanObject and ExecutionResult flows.\n    • Deterministic DAG-based execution via L3.\n    • Stream callbacks for observability (optional).\n    • Meta-profile integration (planning, routing, safety, correction).\n    • Safety + policy + arbitration pipeline at the end of run.\n    • Run summary injected with safety, policy, arbitration, meta-profile.\n\nThis file contains NO business logic, NO tool calls, NO reasoning,\nNO planning. Its purpose is purely orchestration across layers.\n')),
    ImportFrom(
      module='__future__',
      names=[
        alias(name='annotations')],
      level=0),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='asyncio')]),
    ImportFrom(
      module='typing',
      names=[
        alias(name='Any'),
        alias(name='Dict'),
        alias(name='Optional'),
        alias(name='Callable')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='l1',
      names=[
        alias(name='plan', asname='l1_plan')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='l3',
      names=[
        alias(name='DAGExecutor')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='l4',
      names=[
        alias(name='StateAdapter')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='l5',
      names=[
        alias(name='SafetyEngine'),
        alias(name='PolicyEngine'),
        alias(name='ArbitrationEngine'),
        alias(name='SafetyMode')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
